","time":780652097,"poster":"Annihilator",]),(["id":110,"body":"Hi healers:
    Just added a new skill *grin* to make medicines, it is called
medical(藥物調配). You can buy herb bowl from Medic Wang and make
medicines. The chance to succeed depend on your medical skill and
how difficulty the medicine can be made.

    Test it and report if any bug.

PS/ The medicine you made is better than you can bought. They cause
    no sick and may have varies advantages.

                                                  - Annihilator
